Zstandard libzstd
=================

Source package: https://github.com/cataggar/zstd
Commit: 45b6dfcd9d0ffdba99fb653c66b233179b9f7229
Upstream: https://github.com/facebook/zstd (Zstandard 1.6.0)
License: BSD-3-Clause

debz uses libzstd's in-process streaming decoder for zstd repository metadata
and Debian payload members. The source-built static library disables command-
line tools, multithreading, legacy formats, and assembly; no zstd command-line
tool is invoked in production.

