OpenPGP verifier
================

The production OpenPGP verifier adds no third-party dependency. It uses Zig
0.16.0 standard-library SHA-1 (fingerprints only), SHA-256, SHA-512, RSA, and
Ed25519 verification primitives under Zig's MIT license.

The checked-in OpenPGP fixture bytes were generated with Python cryptography
45.0.4 (Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause). This package is an optional fixture
regeneration tool only: it is not fetched, linked, imported, or executed by the
debz build or test graph, and none of its source code is distributed here.
